    "q": "How many assets does one SKU need for China?",
    "a": "No platform publishes a required count. Counted from the published figures on this page, one SKU across Tmall, JD, Douyin, RedNote, WeChat and Weibo fills 24 slots for organic posts and marketplace listings, or 27 with Douyin's paid formats, and 17 distinct files come out of the shoot. That is arithmetic with a stated scope, not a platform requirement."
