    "a": "Yes, if the shoot covers four set-ups rather than one frame: a 3:4 still, a 9:16 video, a wide landscape frame and a white background. On the published figures, Tmall and JD take the same square set in a different order, and a centered 3:4 cut of a 1080 by 1920 frame is exactly the most published RedNote cover size."
  },
  {
    "q": "Which China assets are re-crops and which need new capture?",
    "a": "Of the 24 core slots counted here, four take a frame at its captured ratio, eight are re-crops, eight re-use or re-export a file already made, and four are re-edits or page builds. The white-background image is the one listing asset a styled frame cannot supply, and Douyin's paid formats each need their own cut."
  },
  {
