    "a": "A 3:4 still at 1440 by 1920 or larger, a 9:16 video at 1080 by 1920 or larger with a clean three-second opening, a wide landscape frame for the WeChat lead cover, and a white-background set-up with one centered, front-view product. Add category close-ups, such as a food label, only where the category calls for them."
  },
  {
    "q": "How many aspect ratios does a China launch need?",
    "a": "Five on this page's count: 1:1, 3:4, 9:16, 2.35:1 and 5:4, plus detail page and article body widths, which are builds rather than frames. Every square slot is a centered cut of the 3:4 still, so no separate square set-up is needed. Most of the ratios are commonly published values, not platform readings."
  }
];
